              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JackieT"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Giving this four stars for the technique and effort, but, this was not a flavor profile either of us enjoyed--did I use too sweet Italian sausage, too fatty--or was it the scorching after adding the rice and simmering (without stirring--doh)?? I am not sure, but, we did not care for it. However, it came together beautifully. Made and reviewed for my YouTube channel. Jackie/Famished Farm",
